{"unit_id":"tag:036F:title","translation":"在源（source）上局部的（local）态射（morphisms）性质（Properties）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"source","target_term":"源"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"source","target_term":"源","context":"态射的源；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部的","context":"相对于拓扑的源上局部性；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本节讨论的态射；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"Properties","target_term":"性质","context":"态射的局部性质；尚待术语批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:036F:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n经常可以在与某个其他态射（morphism）预复合（precomposing）之后，证明一个态射（morphism）具有某种性质（property）。在许多情形下，这意味着该态射（morphism）本身也具有这一性质（property）。我们将在下面的定义中将其形式化。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"precomposing","target_term":"预复合"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"与其他态射预复合及被考察的态射；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"precomposing","target_term":"预复合","context":"在所考察态射之前复合其他态射；尚待术语批准。"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质","context":"在预复合后考察的数学性质；尚待术语批准。"}],"notes":[]}
